=   entry .Error   raised when a candidate cannot be staged
-     detail
+     detail

-         Error `↯/s.140.1`: _could not stage the upgrade because `reason`_, raised by `Upgrade.stage`.
-         The reason is a `Clarification`, so the full code is `↯/s.140.1.1` to `↯/s.140.1.3`:
-         `CannotReadSource` (1) — _the upgrade source could not be read_; `CannotWritePending`
-         (2) — _the .pending file could not be written_; `CannotResolveName` (3) — _the
-         running application's name is not available_, which is the case for a JVM run
-         without a launcher.
-     entry .Reason   why the candidate could not be staged
+         Erro `↯/s.140.1`: _could not stage the upgrade because `reason`_, lançado por
+         `Upgrade.stage`. O motivo é uma `Clarification`, então o código completo vai de
+         `↯/s.140.1.1` a `↯/s.140.1.3`: `CannotReadSource` (1) — _the upgrade source could
+         not be read_; `CannotWritePending` (2) — _the .pending file could not be written_;
+         `CannotResolveName` (3) — _the running application's name is not available_, que é o
+         caso de uma JVM executada sem launcher.
+     entry .Reason   por que o candidato não pôde ser preparado

